# OSV waivers for the bashy executable, one exact GO-YYYY-NNNN id per line.
# This entry applies only to the opt-in bashy_engines build tag. The default
# and embed_runner builds do not link the affected OpenPGP package.
#
# GO-2026-5932 has no fixed golang.org/x/crypto version: openpgp is deprecated
# and remains linked through go.podman.io/image/v5/signature in the Podman
# engine's image-signature path. That path can process untrusted signatures;
# this waiver records an unpatched dependency, not non-reachability. Recorded
# by Story #2102 for s443-manager review. Retire when go.podman.io/image/v5
# replaces OpenPGP in this path, then rescan.
GO-2026-5932 no fixed x/crypto version; Podman image-signature OpenPGP dependency in bashy_engines; retire when upstream replaces it
